        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10 rooms. 10 dark pasts. Each door hides a secret. Welcome to The Roadside MOTEL..</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Roadside MOTEL - Game Description<br>10 rooms. 10 hidden pasts. Each one darker than the last.<br>The Roadside MOTEL invites you into a mysterious and unsettling visual novel experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one stays here by chance.<br>Every guest hides a secret. Every room holds a story waiting to be told.<br>And sometimes, silence is more dangerous than words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters and scenarios in each room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological journey that blurs reality, memory, and fear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive atmosphere where even silence has weight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you dare, knock on the door.<br>But remember: Sometimes the loudest scream... is no answer at all.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10 rooms. 10 dark pasts. Each door hides a secret. Welcome to The Roadside MOTEL..</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Roadside MOTEL - Game Description<br>10 rooms. 10 hidden pasts. Each one darker than the last.<br>The Roadside MOTEL invites you into a mysterious and unsettling visual novel experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one stays here by chance.<br>Every guest hides a secret. Every room holds a story waiting to be told.<br>And sometimes, silence is more dangerous than words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters and scenarios in each room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological journey that blurs reality, memory, and fear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive atmosphere where even silence has weight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you dare, knock on the door.<br>But remember: Sometimes the loudest scream... is no answer at all.</p>",
        "short_description": "The Roadside MOTEL: 10 rooms. 10 dark pasts. Silence tells more than lies. No one is who they seem. If you dare, knock on the door. But sometimes, the loudest scream is no answer at all.",
